Dear Team,

Some of the SSL providers are already rolled out TLS 1.3 ( OpenSSL , Boring=
SSL etc) .

Does the TLS 1.3 draft is finalized yet ?

https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-28


Regards,
Ipsito

--_000_DM6PR15MB2266E95752925D1E5D990FFC87870DM6PR15MB2266namp_
